_:genid5 <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/name> "Oscar Corcho" .

_:genid6 <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/name> "Designated RINF Topical Working Groups"@en .

_:genid7 <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/name> "Ghislain Atemezing" ;
          <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://orcid.org/0000-0003-1562-6922> ;
          <http://www.w3.org/ns/org#memberOf> <http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/corporate-body/ERA> .

